### Create it through the interface

1. In the Variation Points graph, find **Robotic fastening cell**.
2. Double-click its displayed **Tags** attribute.
3. Enter the following definition.

| Field | Enter or select |
|---|---|
| Name | Robotic cell maintenance classification |
| Kind | `primitiveTag` (prefilled) |
| Target type | `element` (prefilled) |
| Target | Robotic fastening cell (prefilled) |
| Feature expression | `feature-robotic-fastening` |
| Typed feature-value conditions | Leave blank |
| Property path | `tags` (prefilled) |
| Realization domain | `resources` |

4. Create the Advanced Analytics rule first and the fallback second.

| Order | Rule feature expression | Typed conditions | Realized value |
|---:|---|---|---|
